text:
THIS IS A 25% CHANCE FILLER FOR THE GROUP BREAK LISTED IN THE TITLE. 25% of the participants will receive a spot in this break and 75% will NOT receive a spot in this break.
By purchasing a filler you acknowledge there is a chance you may not get into the break.
Filler spots may be added or subtracted as needed but that does not mathematically change the 25% chance each filler spot holds. 
If you have any questions or concerns with any of the above terms please do not purchase a filler spot unless you are satisfied with the way these are offered.
Fillers are run using random.org
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
