All autos, memorabilia, and high-value cards will be sleeved and top loaded. All other cards will be protected in bulk.
When purchasing a spot in my breaks, you will receive ALL cards associated with your assigned team/spot.
By Purchasing spots in group breaks you agree to the terms, conditions, and rules of each specific break/listing.
There are no guarantees that you will receive a specific team, player, or card.
When purchasing spots in group breaks you acknowledge and accept that you may not receive any cards from your purchase. If this scenario occurs, the breaker will send you cards or sealed product/packs at their discretion.
